<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>화공 플랜트 설계 LLM - 전체 워크플로우 & R&R & 코드맵</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --bg-light: #111827;
      --card-bg: #020617;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --accent-soft: rgba(56,189,248,0.2);
      --accent-2: #22c55e;
      --text: #e5e7eb;
      --muted: #9ca3af;
      --border: #1f2933;
      --danger: #f97316;
      --shadow-soft: 0 18px 45px rgba(15,23,42,0.65);
      --radius-xl: 18px;
      --radius-lg: 14px;
      --radius-pill: 999px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Pretendard", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1f2937 0, #020617 55%, #000 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.5;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .page {
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 280px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }

    /* Left Sidebar */
    .sidebar {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(15,23,42,0.9), rgba(15,23,42,0.6));
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 20px 18px 22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.18);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
      position: sticky;
      top: 24px;
      height: fit-content;
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .logo-icon {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 0, #38bdf8 0, #0ea5e9 40%, #0f172a 85%);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(56,189,248,0.55);
    }

    .logo-text-title {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #f9fafb;
    }

    .logo-text-sub {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .sidebar-section-title {
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .pill-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .pill {
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.35);
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.8);
      cursor: default;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .pill.highlight {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: #e0f2fe;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(56,189,248,0.3), rgba(15,23,42,0.9));
    }

    .toc {
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1px dashed rgba(148,163,184,0.3);
    }

    .toc-group-title {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 10px 0 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    .toc ul {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .toc li {
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .toc a {
      display: block;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #cbd5f5;
      padding: 5px 8px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }

    .toc a:hover {
      border-color: rgba(148,163,184,0.5);
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.9);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .sidebar-note {
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding: 10px 10px 10px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(148,163,184,0.5);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.85);
    }

    /* Main Area */
    .main {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .hero {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(56,189,248,0.24), rgba(15,23,42,0.96));
      border-radius: 26px;
      padding: 20px 22px 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.4);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: -40%;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 0%, rgba(56,189,248,0.22) 0, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 100%, rgba(34,197,94,0.16) 0, transparent 55%);
      opacity: 0.7;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .hero-main {
      max-width: 70%;
      min-width: 260px;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .hero-badge {
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      border: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.8);
      color: #dbeafe;
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.4);
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      margin-top: 8px;
      color: #e5e7eb;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .hero-tags {
      margin-top: 10px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .hero-tag {
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.7);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.6);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .hero-right {
      min-width: 220px;
      max-width: 280px;
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.92);
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.6);
      padding: 10px 14px 12px;
    }

    .hero-right-title {
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .hero-right-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .hero-right-grid strong {
      display: block;
      color: #e5e7eb;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    /* Timeline */
    .section {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(15,23,42,0.96), #020617);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 18px 18px 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(30,64,175,0.55);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    }

    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: baseline;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .section-pill {
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.4);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .section-desc {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .timeline {
      position: relative;
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding-left: 10px;
    }

    .timeline::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 14px;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(56,189,248,0.4), rgba(56,189,248,0.04));
    }

    .timeline-item {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .timeline-dot {
      position: absolute;
      left: 6px;
      top: 6px;
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 0, #38bdf8, #0ea5e9);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(56,189,248,0.18);
    }

    .timeline-card {
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.96);
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.4);
      padding: 10px 12px;
    }

    .timeline-phase-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .timeline-phase-title {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .timeline-phase-meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 4px;
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .meta-tag {
      padding: 2px 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.4);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .meta-tag.core {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: #e0f2fe;
      background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08);
    }

    .timeline-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1.1fr 1.2fr;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .timeline-block-title {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #e5e7eb;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .timeline-block-list {
      list-style: none;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .timeline-block-list li {
      margin-bottom: 3px;
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 10px;
    }

    .timeline-block-list li::before {
      content: "•";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .code-chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      font-size: 10px;
      padding: 2px 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.5);
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.95);
      margin: 2px 2px 2px 0;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .code-chip span {
      font-size: 9px;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    .code-chip.core {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(56,189,248,0.4);
    }

    .code-chip.safety {
      border-color: var(--danger);
    }

    /* Discipline map */
    .discipline-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .discipline-card {
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.98);
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.5);
      padding: 8px 10px 8px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .discipline-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .discipline-title {
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .discipline-tagline {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .discipline-list {
      margin-top: 3px;
      list-style: none;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .discipline-list li {
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    /* R&R table (condensed) */
    .rr-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .rr-table th,
    .rr-table td {
      border: 1px solid rgba(31,41,55,0.9);
      padding: 4px 6px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .rr-table th {
      background: rgba(15,23,42,1);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }

    .rr-table td {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 1080px) {
      .page {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }
      .sidebar {
        position: static;
        order: -1;
      }
      .hero-inner {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .hero-main {
        max-width: 100%;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 840px) {
      body {
        padding: 14px;
      }
      .timeline-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .discipline-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .discipline-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .hero-title {
        font-size: 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <!-- Sidebar -->
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="logo">
      <div class="logo-icon">⚙️</div>
      <div>
        <div class="logo-text-title">Plant LLM</div>
        <div class="logo-text-sub">화공 플랜트 설계 · 운영 전주기 맵</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sidebar-section-title">Lifecycle</div>
    <div class="pill-list">
      <div class="pill highlight">기획·컨셉 (Pre-FEED)</div>
      <div class="pill">기본설계 (FEED)</div>
      <div class="pill">상세설계</div>
      <div class="pill">구매·제작</div>
      <div class="pill">시공</div>
      <div class="pill">시운전·성능시험</div>
      <div class="pill">운전·정비·FFS</div>
    </div>

    <div class="sidebar-section-title">Discipline</div>
    <div class="pill-list">
      <div class="pill">Process</div>
      <div class="pill">Piping</div>
      <div class="pill">Mechanical</div>
      <div class="pill">Instrumentation</div>
      <div class="pill">Safety / SIS</div>
      <div class="pill">Operations</div>
    </div>

    <div class="toc">
      <div class="toc-group-title">섹션 바로가기</div>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#hero">개요 & 목표</a></li>
        <li><a href="#timeline">Lifecycle 워크플로우</a></li>
        <li><a href="#discipline-map">분야별 코드맵</a></li>
        <li><a href="#rr">R&R 테이블</a></li>
      </ul>

      <div class="toc-group-title">핵심 코드 앵커</div>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#timeline">ASME B31.3 / VIII / IX</a></li>
        <li><a href="#timeline">API 520 / 521 / 650 / 610</a></li>
        <li><a href="#discipline-map">API 554 / IEC 61511</a></li>
        <li><a href="#discipline-map">ISO 10628 / ISA 5.1</a></li>
        <li><a href="#timeline">CCPS Dynamic Simulation</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="sidebar-note">
      이 페이지는 <strong>Lead Process Engineer (Gas Technologies)</strong>의 Job Description을 기준으로,<br>
      <strong>LLM이 알아야 할 전주기 설계·운영 기준</strong>을 시각화한 구조입니다.
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- Main -->
  <main class="main">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero" id="hero">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-main">
          <div class="hero-title">
            화공 플랜트 설계 특화 LLM
            <span class="hero-badge">Workflow · R&amp;R · Codes Map</span>
          </div>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">
            기획 &rarr; FEED &rarr; 상세설계 &rarr; 구매·제작 &rarr; 시공 &rarr; 시운전 &rarr; 운전/정비까지.<br/>
            각 단계에서 <strong>어떤 R&amp;R</strong>이 수행되고, 어떤 <strong>국제 코드·표준</strong>을 따라야 하는지 한눈에 정리한
            <strong>LLM 학습용 설계 지도</strong>입니다.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-tags">
            <span class="hero-tag">⚙️ Lead Process Engineer · Gas Technologies</span>
            <span class="hero-tag">📐 PFD / P&amp;ID / MSD / Line Sizing</span>
            <span class="hero-tag">🚀 Dynamic Simulation · Commissioning</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-right">
          <div class="hero-right-title">LLM의 핵심 목표</div>
          <div class="hero-right-grid">
            <div>
              <strong>1. 휴먼 에러 감소</strong>
              PFD/P&amp;ID, PSV sizing, Line sizing, Safety Logic에서
              <strong>코드 위반·누락 자동 검출</strong>.
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>2. 공수 최적화</strong>
              제안~시운전까지 반복 업무를
              <strong>규격 기반 템플릿 &amp; 자동 생성</strong>으로 전환.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Timeline -->
    <section class="section" id="timeline">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-title">
          전체 라이프사이클 워크플로우
          <span class="section-pill">기획 → 설계 → 건설 → 시운전 → 운전</span>
        </div>
        <div class="section-desc">
          각 단계별 <strong>핵심 R&amp;R</strong>과 이를 지탱하는 <strong>대표 코드/표준</strong>을 연결한 타임라인입니다.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline">
        <!-- Phase 1 -->
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-card">
            <div class="timeline-phase-header">
              <div class="timeline-phase-title">Phase 1. 비즈니스 기획 · 컨셉 설계 (Pre-FEED)</div>
              <div class="timeline-phase-meta">
                <span class="meta-tag core">Lead Process 중심</span>
                <span class="meta-tag">Proposal / RFQ 대응</span>
                <span class="meta-tag">Concept Selection</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-grid">
              <div>
                <div class="timeline-block-title">주요 R&amp;R</div>
                <ul class="timeline-block-list">
                  <li>RFQ/Client Spec 분석, 기술 요구사항 정리</li>
                  <li>Gas treating / Dehydration / Compression 등 기술 선택</li>
                  <li>초기 Heat &amp; Mass Balance, 블록 PFD, UFD 작성</li>
                  <li>개략 라인·장비 사이징 (탱크, HX, 펌프, 압축기)</li>
                  <li>제안용 공정 패키지, Technical Proposal 작성</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="timeline-block-title">설계 기준 · 코드</div>
                <div class="code-chip core">API 520 / 521 <span>PSV &amp; Depressuring</span></div>
                <div class="code-chip">ASME B31.3 <span>Process Piping 기본</span></div>
                <div class="code-chip">ASME Sec VIII Div.1 <span>압력용기 개략 설계</span></div>
                <div class="code-chip">API 650 / 620 <span>저장탱크 개념 설계</span></div>
                <div class="code-chip">ISO 10628 <span>PFD/UFD 도면 규칙</span></div>
                <div class="code-chip">CCPS Hazard Eval<span>위험성 시나리오 개략</span></div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="timeline-block-title">LLM 자동화 예시</div>
                <ul class="timeline-block-list">
                  <li>RFQ 텍스트 입력 → 요구 사양 및 코드 의무사항 자동 추출</li>
                  <li>Gas process 선택 옵션 제시 (기술/Capex/Opex 비교 표)</li>
                  <li>API 521 Fire case 가정 기반 대략적 flare load 산정</li>
                  <li>ISO 10628 심볼로 표현된 블록 PFD 자동 생성</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase 2 -->
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-card">
            <div class="timeline-phase-header">
              <div class="timeline-phase-title">Phase 2. 기본설계 / FEED</div>
              <div class="timeline-phase-meta">
                <span class="meta-tag core">Process 주도</span>
                <span class="meta-tag">PFD/UFD/MSD/Line List</span>
                <span class="meta-tag">초기 P&amp;ID · HAZID</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-grid">
              <div>
                <div class="timeline-block-title">주요 R&amp;R</div>
                <ul class="timeline-block-list">
